Arm new-idea                                                                                             consent preview

  schedule  30 7 * * 1, catch-up once
  manual    allowed
  agent     claude (Claude Code)
  command   claude -p --output-format stream-json --verbose --model claude-sonnet-5 --permission-mode default
  model     anthropic/claude-sonnet-5
  timeout   20m
  pre 0     script: python3 scripts/gather_notes.py
  post 0    prompt: "Check the plan fits in one page."
  files     AUTOMATION.md
            scripts/gather_notes.py

  Arming lets it run on this machine, with your credentials. Scripts run with your permissions.













